    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude90 Planet untamed. Future uncertain.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken as a scout for alien life. Your mission is simple: collect information for your human creators before they arrive. But this world does not bow to human hands. And maybe, <strong>neither should you.\u00a0</strong>Who are you? A <strong>pawn</strong>? A <strong>protector</strong>? A <strong>predator</strong>?  Or something else entirely?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f Take Flight. Find Your Truth.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-linear</strong> \u2013  Learn the secret rhythms of the wild <strong>on your own terms.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your place within the cycle or disrupt it entirely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift between towering canopies, boom through caverns, and track the echoes of a <strong>long-abandoned human terraforming attempt.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Discover the beauty and brutality of a living ecosystem.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flora, fauna, and environment interact in surprising and systemic ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action ripples through the world.  Nature will <strong>remember.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lush valleys flood with seasonal blooms, predators stalk under the cover of darkness, and storms force you to rethink your movement.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0a Speak the Language of the Wild </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your voice is your power\u2014<strong>create, destroy, and understand.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\ud83d\udce1 Echolocate</i></strong><i> \u2013 Reveal the hidden. Map the unknown.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83d\udde3 <strong>Shout</strong> \u2013 Send shockwaves through the land itself.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83d\udcac <strong>Whisper</strong> \u2013 Form bonds that  last a lifetime\u2026 or shatter in an instant.</i> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude90 Planet untamed. Future uncertain.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken as a scout for alien life. Your mission is simple: collect information for your human creators before they arrive. But this world does not bow to human hands. And maybe, <strong>neither should you.\u00a0</strong>Who are you? A <strong>pawn</strong>? A <strong>protector</strong>? A <strong>predator</strong>?  Or something else entirely?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f Take Flight. Find Your Truth.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-linear</strong> \u2013  Learn the secret rhythms of the wild <strong>on your own terms.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your place within the cycle or disrupt it entirely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift between towering canopies, boom through caverns, and track the echoes of a <strong>long-abandoned human terraforming attempt.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Discover the beauty and brutality of a living ecosystem.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flora, fauna, and environment interact in surprising and systemic ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action ripples through the world.  Nature will <strong>remember.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lush valleys flood with seasonal blooms, predators stalk under the cover of darkness, and storms force you to rethink your movement.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0a Speak the Language of the Wild </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your voice is your power\u2014<strong>create, destroy, and understand.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\ud83d\udce1 Echolocate</i></strong><i> \u2013 Reveal the hidden. Map the unknown.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83d\udde3 <strong>Shout</strong> \u2013 Send shockwaves through the land itself.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83d\udcac <strong>Whisper</strong> \u2013 Form bonds that  last a lifetime\u2026 or shatter in an instant.</i> </p>",
